WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.837
Before the doors open,
your team needs one plan.

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.677
We map the room, the vendors,
the staff, and the run of show.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.617
When you hire us
to produce your event,

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.577
our digital event
and logistics system

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.470
comes with our service,
free of charge.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.397
Guests register. At the door,
your welcome team

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.390
checks them in on the same list.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.097
Behind the scenes, staff can see
their assignments and the schedule.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.757
After the event, you can keep
using the system for future events.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.960
Tell us what you’re planning.
We’ll help you bring it to life.
